              "text": "चौकशी करणे — caukśī karṇe — \"to inquire; to question\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हवालदाराने दुकानदाराकडे चौकशी केली. havāldārāne dukāndārākaḍe caukśī kelī. The constable made inquiries with the shopkeeper."
