              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने चौकशी केली, tyāne caukśī kelī."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The person asked takes -कडे; the matter takes -ची: अपघाताची चौकशी करणे (caukśī karṇe), to look into an accident."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
