          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चौकशी करणे (caukśī karṇe) joins caukśī, 'an inquiry', to karṇe, 'to do'; the origin of caukśī is not settled."
            }
